# Cloudflare static-asset redirects (https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/).
#
# Every frame has its own address, /app/frames/<id>/. The build writes a page
# for each bundled frame, but My frames are made in the browser, so any other
# id is served the build's fallback frame page (a 200 rewrite: the address bar
# keeps the frame's id, and the app reads it from there).
/app/frames/:id /app/frames/:id/ 301
/app/frames/:id/ /app/frames/_/ 200
/app/:version/frames/:id /app/:version/frames/:id/ 301
/app/:version/frames/:id/ /app/:version/frames/_/ 200
